- HealthBench: https://huggingface.co/datasets/openai/healthbench
- MedHallTune: https://huggingface.co/datasets/russellyq/MedHallTune
- MedSafetyBench: https://github.com/AI4LIFE-GROUP/med-safety-bench
- RxSafeBench: https://github.com/CAS-SIAT-XinHai/RxSafeBench
